    "description": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Made with Camas Swale Farm sweet and hot peppers. A seasonal</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">collaboration with Wildcraft Brewing company. Lacto-fermented and canned</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">by Wildcraft in their certified kitchen, spiced with just salt and pepper. Very</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">flavorful with a mild heat. One year shelf life, refridgeration recommended.</span></p>",
